  "description": "Kitchen Wars is a fast-paced party game for 2–8 players that throws you into the chaos of a busy restaurant, where you’ll need to fight strategically and pull off cheeky steals while serving your customers.\n\nUse weapons, pinch chairs, throw items, level up to unlock boosters, and have an absolute blast. Deliver meals quickly to keep customers happy and satisfied. Upgrade your kitchen and unlock powerful boosters.\n\nDisrupt your rivals with strategic attacks and sabotage. Cut down your competitors’ seating capacity by nabbing their chairs. Upgrade your restaurant: earn money from happy customers to invest back into your kitchen and secure the win.\n\nWhether you’re focused on improving your restaurant or stirring up chaos for your opponents, Kitchen Wars delivers a fun and competitive mix of strategy, combat, and humour.\n",
